          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the passage of a long trail in the sky: certain observation of the disintegration upon its entry into the atmosphere of a Soyuz rocket stage cataloged under the number \"15035B/40745\".",
          "translation_text_sha256": "b0b5410cb7243180c42193e042b626203a17327293c16558c60e9bde45687e4b"
